 ('SRC_URBAN_SCIENTOLOGY','secondary scholarship','Hugh B. Urban, The Church of Scientology: A History of a New Religion (Princeton University Press, 2011)','Scholarly history of Scientology covering Hubbard, Dianetics, the thetan, the OT levels and the Xenu/Incident II cosmogony'),
